{{Description|This enemy has a higher RES to {{Color|[[Spectro]] DMG|nobold=1}}.<br /><br />Twin Nova: Nebulous Cannon sports a top-of-the-line Combat Synergy Module. Combined with Twin Nova: Collapsar Blade, their battle synergy turns into a deadly dance of multi-pronged attacks.<br /><br />When Twin Nova: Nebulous Cannon is hit by Tune Break, it takes 20% more total DMG for 30s, stacking up to 3 times.<br /><br />The Twin Nova mechs were built for exploration beyond the Stridergate. Nebulous Cannon is the ranged model. Their humanoid form embodies mankind's drive to explore the abyss when they look up at the stars.<br /><br />Together as one, paired Twin Novas demonstrate unprecedented combat capabilities.|Description When Discovered}} 

